title: Inter-Party Relationships
new-page: true
view-if: year <= 1936 and inter_party_relationships_timer <= 0
tags: party_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; inter_party_relationships_timer = 6;
card-image: img/weimar_coalition_2.jpg
max-visits: 20
#subtitle: Building relations with the other political parties of Germany.

= Inter-Party Relationships

The KPD has refused cooperation with all bourgeuoise parties up to this point. Should we continue our isolation, or reach out to other parties.

- @spd: Infiltrate the rank and file of the SPD, and aid their left-wing to repair relations.
- @center: Reach out to the left-wing of the christian trade unions, and strengthen their role within the Catholic Center Party to increase our relations..
- @kpd_alone: The KPD can stand alone for now.
- @easy_discard


@spd
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; kpd_inter_party_seen += 1
go-to: kpd_blutmai if blutmai = 1; kpd_1 if blutmai = 0 and kpd_coalition_success = 0 and (kpd_relation < 40 or kpd_rectified_history = 1); kpd_rectification_of_history if kpd_relation >= 40 and kpd_rectified_history = 0; kpd_2 if kpd_coalition_success = 1 and kpd_rectified_history = 1

@spd_1
on-arrival: spd_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); united_front_support += 1; popular_front_support +=1 if kpd_inter_party_seen <= 1; thalmannites_dissent += 5

The SPD is suspicious of our overtures, especially due to our history of conflict. However, connections are easily made at the grassroots and local levels among the unions and chapters.

@kpd_rectification_of_history

One stumbling block for our relations with the SPD is our history of conflict, dating back to 1918 and 1919. The KPD is especially contemptuous of Gustav Noske, the SPD "bloodhound" who reportedly ordered the violent suppression of the Spartacist uprising and other KPD revolts. They SPD is also blamed for the deaths of Rosa Luxemburg and Karl Liebknecht, two SPD-turned-KPD leaders who were killed during the suppression of the uprising.

For further improvements in SPD relations, we demand the expulsion of Noske and a commemoration of Luxemburg and Liebknecht.

- @yes_history: Yes, we must apologize for our past actions.
- @no_history: No, we have no need to apologize.

@yes_history
choose-if: spd_party_leader = "seydewitz" or spd_party_leader = "breitscheid" and spd_relations > 40
unavailable-subtitle: The SPD left is not strong enough.
on-arrival: thalmannites_dissent += 12; thalmannites_strength -= 5; labor_wing_dissent -= 5; labor_wing_strength +=5; conciliators_dissent -= 6; conciliators_strength += 10; kpd_rectified_history = 1; spd_relation += 8*(1-dissent)

As part of normalizing relations with us, the SPD has acknowledged the wrongdoings of our past. The bloodhound Noske is expelled, and public commemorations are held for those killed by troops during the uprisings.

This leads to serious tensions with the thalmannites within our party, and anger from Stalin.

@no_history
on-arrival: spd_relation -= 3

The SPD refuses to acknowledge its murderous past.


@spd_2
on-arrival: spd_relation += 8*(1 - dissent); united_front_support += 1; popular_front_support +=1 if kpd_inter_party_seen <= 1; thalmannites_dissent += 5

After the success of the coalition government with the SPD, they are much more amenable to us.

@spd_blutmai
on-arrival: spd_relation += 3*(1 - dissent); thalmannites_dissent += 5; labor_wing_dissent += 5

After the events of Blütmai, reconciling with the SPD is difficult, if not impossible. Nevertheless, we must try.

@center
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_relation += 2 if z_party_leader == "Joos"
go-to: center_op if z_in_government = 1 and spd_in_government = 0 and chancellor != "Brüning"; center_coalition if spd_in_government = 1 and z_in_government = 1; center_bruning if chancellor = "Brüning"

@center_op
on-arrival: z_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); thalmannites_dissent +=5; popular_front_support +=1

Reaching out to Zentrum is unthinkable for some in the party, and our history as a party has alienated much of their leadership against us. However, this does not preclude feelings of goodwill among the rank and file.

@center_coalition
on-arrival: z_relation += 8*(1 - dissent)

We are currently coalition partners with them, so improving relations comes naturally.

@center_bruning
on-arrival: z_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)

The Brüning semi-autocratic regime makes building friendly relations difficult, but not impossible.

@kpd_alone

Whether it is because we *cannot* or *will not*, we do not make ties with other parties at this moment.

- @return: Continue...
